    "wsWinStyleId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 7280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have been praying for a financial\nbreakthrough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3320,
    "dDurationMs": 8120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fasting, declaring, believing,\nand the account is still short at the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9280,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "end of every month.\nMeanwhile, someone at your office who"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13520,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never opens a Bible just bought his\nsecond property."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17720,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And somewhere quiet, you have been\nasking the question you are almost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21400,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "afraid to say out loud.\nGod,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25360,
    "dDurationMs": 8480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "did the blessing skip me?\nHere is what nobody told you in church."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31280,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "God already answered that prayer.\nHe answered it in Proverbs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36000,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He answered it in Genesis.\nHe answered it in the words of Jesus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40280,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "himself.\nThe blueprint for building wealth is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44080,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sitting in the book on your nightstand.\nYou just never read it as a financial"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48520,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "manual.\nAnd I am not talking about tithe and God"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52800,
    "dDurationMs": 8080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will bless you.\nThat is real, but that is page one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58000,
    "dDurationMs": 8120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are pages you have never turned.\nPractical, disciplined, step-by-step"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64000,
    "dDurationMs": 6600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instructions that work whether you start\nwith thousands or start with nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69000,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, if you are tired of being the most\nprayerful person in the room and still"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72880,
    "dDurationMs": 8200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most financially stuck, stay here.\nBecause what God told you to do, you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78560,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "simply have not done it yet.\nThe Bible mentions money more than 2,300"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83840,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "times.\nMore than faith and prayer combined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87560,
    "dDurationMs": 8760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "God was not being subtle. He wanted you\nto understand wealth. Not chase it. Not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93320,
    "dDurationMs": 8200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "worship it. Understand it.\nAnd he gave you a system. Step-by-step,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99600,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "page-by-page.\nMost Christians have never read it as"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103120,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what it actually is.\nA financial manual written by the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107200,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "creator of everything that exists.\nHere are the biblical steps to building"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111640,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wealth.\nNot prosperity gospel. Not name it and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115600,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "claim it.\nThese are disciplinary instructions from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118680,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "scripture that work regardless of where\nyou start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122280,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Step one,\nsharpen your blade before you swing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126560,
    "dDurationMs": 7360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Proverbs 22:29 says,\n\"Do you see a man skilled in his work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131520,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He will stand before kings.\"\nBefore God gave Israel wealth, he gave"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136160,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bezalel skill.\nIn Exodus 31, the Holy Spirit filled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140440,
    "dDurationMs": 8560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that man not with prophecy, not with\ntongues, but with craftsmanship,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145480,
    "dDurationMs": 7680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ability, and intelligence in his hands.\nThat is the first time the spirit of God"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150840,
    "dDurationMs": 7080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "filled a man in all of scripture,\nand it was for work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155400,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You do not need capital to start. You\nneed capability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159959,
    "dDurationMs": 5881,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The most financially struggling person\nwatching this right now has access to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164040,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something worth more than any startup\nloan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166920,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Time to learn.\nA skill is a seed that does not cost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170880,
    "dDurationMs": 8160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money to plant, but once it grows,\npeople will pay for its fruit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176040,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ecclesiastes 10:10 says, \"If the iron is\nblunt and you do not sharpen it, you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181239,
    "dDurationMs": 6241,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "must use more strength.\"\nYou are working twice as hard because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185400,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you never sharpen the tool.\nFix that first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189239,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tonight, pick one skill the market will\npay for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192600,
    "dDurationMs": 8200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Writing, design, coding, cooking,\nediting, tailoring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198400,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "YouTube is free. Apprenticeships are\nfree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201840,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Books at the library are free.\nYou have no excuse and no reason to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206120,
    "dDurationMs": 7480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wait.\nStep two, get up and work like the ant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211120,
    "dDurationMs": 9399,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Proverbs 6:6 says, \"Go to the ant, you\nsluggard. Consider its ways and be wise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217200,
    "dDurationMs": 7600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No commander, no overseer, no ruler.\"\nThe ant does not wait for a boss. It"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222680,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "does not wait for motivation. It does\nnot wait for a prophetic word."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226959,
    "dDurationMs": 7321,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It sees summer and it moves because it\nknows winter is coming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231560,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "James 2:26 says, faith without works is\ndead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235280,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not weak, not struggling, dead.\nAnd a dead faith cannot produce a living"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239960,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "income.\nHere is what broke Christians get wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243560,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They spiritualize laziness. They say\nthey are waiting on God, but God is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248000,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "waiting on them.\nThe widow in 2 Kings chapter 4 was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251720,
    "dDurationMs": 4639,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drowning in debt with creditors at her\ndoor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254600,
    "dDurationMs": 6759,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She cried out for help, and God's\nmiracle required her to move first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259000,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She had to go borrow the jars. She had\nto pour the oil herself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263360,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She had to sell it herself.\nGod multiplied it, but she had to move."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267919,
    "dDurationMs": 5121,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the oil stopped flowing the moment\nshe ran out of jars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271320,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Her preparation determined the size of\nthe miracle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274520,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your effort is not the opposite of\nfaith."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277320,
    "dDurationMs": 7960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your effort is the evidence of it.\nStep three,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282000,
    "dDurationMs": 7919,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "count the cost before you build.\nJesus said in Luke 14, \"Suppose one of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288040,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you wants to build a tower.\nWon't you first sit down and estimate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291720,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the cost to see if you have enough money\nto complete it?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295800,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jesus told you to budget.\nThe son of God literally said, \"Sit down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300880,
    "dDurationMs": 7360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and count.\"\nNot pray about it first. Count."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305400,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Calculate. Plan.\nJoseph did not just pray Egypt through"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310200,
    "dDurationMs": 7320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the famine.\nHe implemented a 20% savings plan across"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314440,
    "dDurationMs": 7200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an entire nation for 7 years.\nThat is a budget."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319240,
    "dDurationMs": 7960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is a financial strategy.\nThat is discipline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324200,
    "dDurationMs": 8120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Proverbs 21:5 says, \"The plans of the\ndiligent lead to profit as surely as"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329960,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "haste leads to poverty.\"\nYou cannot manage a million if you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334320,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cannot manage what is in your hand right\nnow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338120,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If money comes in and disappears and you\ndo not know where it went, you do not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342760,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have an income problem.\nYou have an an problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347080,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Write down every single thing you spend\nfor the next 30 days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351160,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every single thing.\nYou will find the leak."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355240,
    "dDurationMs": 8160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the leak is what is bleeding you.\nStep four."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360160,
    "dDurationMs": 7560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kill debt before it kills your future.\nProverbs 22:7 says, \"The borrower is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365880,
    "dDurationMs": 7480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "slave to the lender.\"\nSlave. Not inconvenienced, not slightly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370840,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "limited, slave.\nEvery debt you carry is a master you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375600,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "serve.\nEvery payment you owe is a portion of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378800,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your future that belongs to someone\nelse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381880,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You cannot build wealth while you are\nfinancing someone else's."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386000,
    "dDurationMs": 7160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Romans 13:8 says, \"Let no debt remain\noutstanding.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390400,
    "dDurationMs": 8360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Deuteronomy 28 says, \"Being debt-free is\na mark of God's blessing, and being in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395520,
    "dDurationMs": 7480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "debt is listed among the curses.\"\nSo, here is the practical plan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401040,
    "dDurationMs": 7360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "List every debt from smallest to\nlargest. Attack the smallest first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406200,
    "dDurationMs": 5719,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pay the minimum on everything else, and\nthrow every extra dollar at the smallest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410560,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "balance.\nWhen it is dead, take what you were"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413520,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "paying on it and stack it onto the next\ndebt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416520,
    "dDurationMs": 7920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Little by little, debt by debt, chain by\nchain, until you are free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422640,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first four steps are about clearing\nthe ground."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425840,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sharpening yourself, moving with\npurpose, planning with discipline, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430200,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "breaking every chain that is holding you\nback."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433840,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, the next five steps are about\nbuilding something on that cleared"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437040,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ground that actually lasts.\nThese are the steps most people never"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441640,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reach because they got stuck in step\nfour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444840,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Keep going.\nStep five. Gather little by little and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448840,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let it multiply.\nProverbs 13:11 says, \"Whoever gathers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453480,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money little by little makes it grow.\"\nThis verse destroys every get-rich-quick"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458440,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "scheme.\nEvery double-your-money-in-30-days"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461400,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "promise.\nEvery plan that skips patience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465080,
    "dDurationMs": 7720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "God said the path to growth is small,\nconsistent, faithful accumulation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470360,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not one big moment, a thousand small\nones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474200,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jesus took this further in the parable\nof the talents in Matthew 25."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478800,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The master gave three servants money.\nThe first two invested and doubled what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482920,
    "dDurationMs": 7240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they had. The third buried his in the\nground and played it safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487520,
    "dDurationMs": 8120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The master did not call him cautious.\nHe called him wicked and lazy for doing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492760,
    "dDurationMs": 8680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nothing with what he was given.\nGod expects multiplication."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498040,
    "dDurationMs": 8400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not storage, not survival.\nEven if all you can save right now is 5%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504080,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your income, save it.\nThen put it to work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508520,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A hundred saved consistently becomes a\nthousand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511919,
    "dDurationMs": 7560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A thousand becomes 10,000.\nThis is not magic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516800,
    "dDurationMs": 8480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the math of patience.\nAnd patience is a biblical command."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523599,
    "dDurationMs": 6001,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Step six.\nSpread your portion across more than one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527480,
    "dDurationMs": 8520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "source.\nEcclesiastes 11:2 says, \"Invest in seven"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533240,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ventures. Yes, in eight.\nFor you do not know what disaster may"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537839,
    "dDurationMs": 5241,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "come.\"\nGod told you not to depend on one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541800,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "income.\nThat is not hustle culture. That is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545280,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "scripture.\nSolomon, the wisest and wealthiest man"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549640,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who ever lived, said, \"Spread it out\nbecause you do not know what tomorrow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554480,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "holds.\"\nThe job could end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557839,
    "dDurationMs": 6761,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The industry could shift.\nThe economy could turn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562040,
    "dDurationMs": 8040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you have planted in seven places,\nyou eat from the ones that survive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567200,
    "dDurationMs": 7600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Proverbs 31 woman ran real estate,\nagriculture, manufacturing, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572360,
    "dDurationMs": 7760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wholesale trade simultaneously.\nFour income streams, one woman."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578000,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And verse 18 says, she saw that her\ntrading was profitable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581960,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She did not hope it was working. She\nchecked the numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586120,
    "dDurationMs": 7560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ecclesiastes 11:4 says, whoever watches\nthe wind will not plant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591080,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Stop waiting for perfect conditions. You\nwill never feel fully ready. Start the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595920,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "side business. Offer the service. Sell\nthe skill you sharpened in step one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601200,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Bible does not despise small\nbeginnings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604240,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Zechariah 4:10 says, do not despise the\nday of small things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609840,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Step seven.\nGuard your walls or lose everything you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613120,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "built.\nProverbs 25:28 says, like a city whose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617720,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "walls are broken through is a person who\nlacks self-control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622400,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the step that separates the\nperson who earns well and stays broke"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626520,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the person who earns modestly and\nbuilds wealth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630200,
    "dDurationMs": 8360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Without self-control, everything leaks.\nImpulse purchases, lifestyle inflation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636160,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "emotional spending.\nThe pressure to look blessed before you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640640,
    "dDurationMs": 8840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually are.\nProverbs 21:17 says, whoever loves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646480,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pleasure will become poor.\nThe designer brands, the daily coffee"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651480,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "run, the subscription you forgot you\nwere still paying for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655440,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These things are not sin,\nbut they are the slow leak that empties"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659400,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the bucket.\nGalatians 5 calls self-control a fruit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663480,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the spirit.\nThis is not just financial advice. It is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667040,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "spiritual warfare.\nEvery time you say no to something you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670760,
    "dDurationMs": 7840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do not need, you are saying yes to the\nfuture God is building for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675800,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Step eight. Walk with the wise and stop\nconsulting fools."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680839,
    "dDurationMs": 7321,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Proverbs 13:20 says, walk with the wise\nand become wise, for a companion of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686000,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fools suffers harm.\nYour circle is your ceiling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690280,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If every person around you is broke\nbitter, you will absorb broke and bitter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694640,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thinking.\nNot because they are bad people, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698080,
    "dDurationMs": 8880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "environment shapes behavior.\nProverbs 15:22 says, \"Plans fail for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704080,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lack of counsel, but with many advisers,\nthey succeed.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708440,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need a mentor. Not a motivational\nspeaker."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712280,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A mentor.\nSomeone who has walked the road you are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715960,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trying to walk and can show you where\nthe pits are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719880,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you do not need to pay for one.\nAsk questions of people further along"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724960,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than you.\nListen more than you talk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728440,
    "dDurationMs": 10280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Apply what you learn.\nProverbs 27:17 says, \"As iron sharpens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735120,
    "dDurationMs": 10440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "iron, so one person sharpens another.\"\nFind that person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741720,
    "dDurationMs": 9160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Step nine. Build with clean hands or\nwatch it crumble."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747600,
    "dDurationMs": 8120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Proverbs 11:1 says, \"The Lord detests\ndishonest scales, but accurate weights"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753640,
    "dDurationMs": 7480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "find favor with him.\"\nGod used the word detests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758680,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the same Hebrew word used for\nidolatry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762640,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He places dishonest business practices\nin the same category as worshiping false"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767760,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gods.\nIf your wealth strategy involves cutting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771400,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "corners, misleading people, or profiting\nfrom someone else's ignorance, you are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776320,
    "dDurationMs": 7600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not building. You are stacking cards on\na table that will not hold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781480,
    "dDurationMs": 7720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Proverbs 13:11 already told you what\nhappens. Dishonest money dwindles away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787440,
    "dDurationMs": 7160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but whoever gathers money little by\nlittle, honestly, consistently,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792120,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "faithfully, makes it grow.\nYour reputation is worth more than your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796839,
    "dDurationMs": 7441,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "revenue.\nProverbs 22:1 says, \"A good name is more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801800,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "desirable than great riches.\"\nAnd Proverbs 13:22 says, \"A good person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807480,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leaves an inheritance for their\nchildren's children.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810600,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is generational wealth.\nAnd it requires integrity as its"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814440,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "foundation.\nLet me say this to you directly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818000,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you have been sitting in church\npraying for breakthrough and wondering"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821400,
    "dDurationMs": 7360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why the blessing has not landed, it is\nnot because God is ignoring you. It is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826080,
    "dDurationMs": 7760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because God does not reward wishes. He\nrewards obedience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831000,
    "dDurationMs": 7640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Deuteronomy 8:18 says, \"Remember the\nLord your God, for it is he who gives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836200,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you the ability to produce wealth.\"\nHe did not say he gives you wealth. He"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840840,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "said he gives you the ability, the\ncapacity, the power. But you have to use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845920,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it.\nThe seed is in your hand. The ground is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849240,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in front of you. He has provided the\nrain and the sun. But nobody can plant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853960,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it for you.\nYou are not cursed. You are not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857000,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forgotten. You are not destined to stay\nwhere you are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860880,
    "dDurationMs": 7200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are simply standing in front of a\nblueprint you have not followed yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865280,
    "dDurationMs": 9440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Start tonight. Pick a skill. Make a\nplan. Kill a debt. Save something. Start"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871880,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something. Just begin.\nBefore you go, I want to ask you one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877000,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "honest question.\nOf these nine steps, which one have you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880800,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "been avoiding?\nNot the one that sounds hardest. The one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884560,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know in your gut you have been\nputting off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887760,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Drop just the number in the comments.\nBecause naming the step you have been"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892040,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "skipping is the first move toward\nactually taking it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895880,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Share this with someone who has been\npraying for financial breakthrough, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899600,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has never seen these scriptures laid out\nas a practical plan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903640,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And subscribe so we can keep going\ndeeper into what God's word actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907640,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "says about building a life of purpose\nand provision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911640,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The blueprint was never hidden.\nYou just had not turned to that page"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915280,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yet.\nTurn it now."
    } ]
  } ]
}
